    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Meimetsu&quot; is an interactive experience set in a mysterious world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can influence the behavior of others by coming into contact with them, and your actions will lead to different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis is not a horror game.\u203b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions and choices will affect others,<br>and their reactions will shape your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your behavior influences people.<br>You will be led to think about the meaning of this world, of people, and of yourself.<br>This world, and the people in it, want to understand <i>you</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 to 60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: This game does not save your story progress.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Meimetsu&quot; is an interactive experience set in a mysterious world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can influence the behavior of others by coming into contact with them, and your actions will lead to different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis is not a horror game.\u203b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions and choices will affect others,<br>and their reactions will shape your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your behavior influences people.<br>You will be led to think about the meaning of this world, of people, and of yourself.<br>This world, and the people in it, want to understand <i>you</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 to 60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note: This game does not save your story progress.</p>",
